Render and compare Flux manifests offline

Usage:
  flate [command]

Available Commands:
  build       Render Flux objects to YAML (defaults to all)
  cache       Prune flate's persistent cache
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  diff        Diff rendered output (defaults to all)
  get         List Flux resources (defaults to all)
  help        Help about any command
  test        Report reconcile status (defaults to all)

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]          help for flate
      --log-level string           Set log level: debug,info,warn,error [env: FLATE_LOG_LEVEL] (default "error")
      --no-progress[=true|false]   Hide live progress on stderr [env: FLATE_NO_PROGRESS]
  -v, --version[=true|false]       version for flate

Use "flate [command] --help" for more information about a command.
